<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Radio Observer — Turkish copy (default locale). Phase 3.5 control screen.
  Keys mirror the 3.1 UiCopyKey inventory (docs/phase3-ux-spec.md section 5) plus the
  status/issue label table. Honesty rules are mandatory: no identity/tracking/distance
  claims; passive Wi-Fi is never described as an active scan; an empty feed never
  proves absence of nearby radios.
-->
